    topic: "Light",
    text: `Light shapes how we see and experience the world. Let's learn collocations for describing different types of light and how light behaves.

The sun <b>floods the room with light</b> (fills a room completely with light) in the morning. Sunlight can be <b>brilliantly bright</b> or, during golden hour, cast a <b>warm golden glow</b> over everything. On a cloudy day, the light is <b>dull and flat</b>.

Artificial lights can create very different effects. A lamp might <b>cast a soft glow</b> (produce a gentle, warm light). A spotlight can <b>illuminate a stage</b> (light it up brightly). Neon signs <b>flash and flicker</b> (go on and off repeatedly). In contrast, candles produce a <b>flickering flame</b> and <b>dim light</b>.

Light can <b>reflect off surfaces</b>, creating interesting visual effects. Water can make light <b>dance and shimmer</b>. Glass and mirrors make light <b>refract</b> (bend). A diamond might <b>sparkle and glitter</b> when light hits it.

In photography and film, getting the <b>lighting right</b> is crucial. A subject can be <b>bathed in light</b> (completely surrounded by light) or be <b>thrown into shadow</b> (made very dark). <b>Natural light</b> is often preferred to <b>artificial lighting</b>.

Light also has symbolic meaning. We talk about someone being <b>in the spotlight</b> (receiving public attention) or <b>shedding light on</b> a topic (explaining it more clearly).`,
    translation_uz: `Yorug'lik bizning dunyoni ko'rish va his qilish usulimizni belgilaydi. Keling, turli yorug'lik turlarini va yorug'likning qanday harakat qilishini tasvirlash uchun so'z birikmalari ustida to'xtalamiz.

Ertalab quyosh xonani yorug'lik bilan to'ldiradi. Quyosh nuri juda yorqin bo'lishi yoki oltin soatda hamma narsaga iliq oltin nuri sochishi mumkin.

Sun'iy chiroqlar juda xilma-xil ta'sirlar yaratishi mumkin. Chiroq yumshoq nур sochishi mumkin. Proektor sahnani yoritishi mumkin. Neon belgilar tez-tez chaqnaydi va pir-pir etadi.

Yorug'lik yuzalardan aks etishi mumkin. Suv yorug'likni o'ynashga va tovlanishga olib kelishi mumkin. Olmos yorug'lik unga teganda yaltiraydi va chaqnaydi.

Yorug'lik ramziy ma'noga ham ega. Biz birov diqqat markazida bo'lish haqida yoki mavzuni tushuntirish haqida gaplashamiz.`,
